# Generated SLayer embedding sidecars — the committed models ship without them;
# YAMLStorage lazily creates an (empty, when embeddings are unavailable) one
# whenever a test/tool opens a model dir. Never commit them. Also baked at
# image-build time for the cloud runner; never source.
slayer_models/*/embeddings.db
slayer_models_otf/*/embeddings.db
# Scratch spec docs — not part of the package.
_specs/

# Gated benchmark gold — licensed for local use only, NEVER redistribute.
# Kept on disk for local `--use-audited-gold-sql` runs; never committed/pushed.
audited_gold/
sar_audited_gold/
